---
import LocationLayout from '../layouts/LocationLayout.astro';
import { locationsBySlug } from '../data/locations';

const location = locationsBySlug['talbot-county'];
---

<LocationLayout 
  location={location}
  title="Personal Injury Lawyer in Talbot County | Alex Poberesky Law"
  description="Experienced personal injury and criminal defense attorney serving Talbot County, Maryland. Free consultation. Call (410) 484-0400."
>
  <h2>Dedicated Legal Representation in Talbot County, Maryland</h2>
  
  <p>
    Talbot County, home to the charming town of Easton and the historic waterfront community 
    of St. Michaels, is one of Maryland's most picturesque Eastern Shore counties. Residents 
    and visitors alike can face serious legal challenges that require experienced representation. 
    Attorney Alex Poberesky provides skilled legal services to Talbot County clients.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Talbot County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Whether you've been injured in a traffic accident on Route 50 or Route 33, hurt in a 
    boating incident on the Miles River or Chesapeake Bay, or suffered harm due to someone 
    else's negligence, you deserve compensation for your injuries. We fight for Talbot County 
    injury victims.
  </p>
  
  <p>Our Talbot County personal injury practice includes:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car accidents on Routes 50, 33, and local roads</li>
    <li>Boating and watercraft accidents</li>
    <li>Bicycle accidents, including tourist-related incidents</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents at businesses and historic properties</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice at UM Shore Medical Center at Easton</li>
    <li>Agricultural accidents</li>
    <li>Premises liability claims</li>
    <li>Wrongful death cases</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Talbot County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Criminal charges can have serious consequences for your reputation and future, especially 
    in a close-knit community like Talbot County. We provide experienced, discreet defense 
    for clients facing DUI charges, drug offenses, assault, theft, and other criminal matters.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Experienced Representation for Eastern Shore Clients</h3>
  
  <p>
    With over 26 years of experience practicing law throughout Maryland, Attorney Poberesky 
    understands the unique needs of Eastern Shore clients. We travel to Easton and throughout 
    Talbot County to meet with clients and appear in court.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Talbot County Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Talbot County, including Easton, St. Michaels, Oxford, 
    Trappe, Tilghman Island, Cordova, and surrounding areas. Contact us today for a free 
    consultation about your personal injury or criminal defense case.
  </p>
</LocationLayout>
